  <SolarWeb-Stratum-GreenhouseGazedTogether.rulePack.rulesStrings.7>desc_sentence-&gt;四个人都仰望天空，神情平和安详。</SolarWeb-Stratum-GreenhouseGazedTogether.rulePack.rulesStrings.7>
